{
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "VO-01",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 5.443,
   "text": "On Tuesday, for the first time in thirty-three years, Nvidia explains its billions without Jensen Huang."
  },
  {
   "id": "VO-02",
   "start": 5.592,
   "end": 7.173,
   "text": "Wait, who's running Nvidia now?"
  },
  {
   "id": "VO-03",
   "start": 7.321,
   "end": 14.06,
   "text": "Jensen resigned last week after a scandal, so the company's money chief is now doing two of the biggest jobs in tech."
  },
  {
   "id": "VO-04",
   "start": 14.16,
   "end": 20.898,
   "text": "Nvidia is the jet every AI company flies on, and investors paid extra because they trusted the pilot in the leather jacket."
  },
  {
   "id": "VO-05",
   "start": 20.998,
   "end": 26.492,
   "text": "That's key person risk, when losing one person can shake a stock even if the business didn't change."
  },
  {
   "id": "VO-06",
   "start": 26.889,
   "end": 32.125,
   "text": "You'd think the jet falls without him, but the factories, the chips and the customers didn't resign."
  },
  {
   "id": "VO-07",
   "start": 32.403,
   "end": 36.42,
   "text": "And Congress still wants to question Jensen behind closed doors on December first."
  },
  {
   "id": "VO-08",
   "start": 36.758,
   "end": 43.47,
   "text": "If you own an S and P five hundred fund, you already have a seat on this jet, so would you fly without him?"
  }
 ],
